; caldera_cistern.room - the flooded cistern under the square's well, the caldera's way in from the village (design 04 section 3.7);
; 'O fundo do poco' (design 02 section 8, Inverno Espacial 2). Ivo drops onto the slab (row 8, cols 7-12) and plays Redoma at its
; east edge: the shell dries the stepped pool (col 13 floor row 13) and the flooded passage (cols 11-12, rows 11-12) under the
; sealed chamber (cols 8-11, rows 9-10), whose trapped air keeps it dry (bugs/well-water-stands-in-the-air-at-a-passage-mouth).
; The chamber's door leads down to caldera_cistern_bottom. Back up: Redoma in the chamber, the step (col 14, row 12) to the
; slab, then the plank beams (rows 5, 1) to the square.

